      "notes": "Power 205 kW / 275 hp combined (94 hp front + 181 hp rear, Moladin; Chery 279 PS). 0-100 6.5 s quoted by Chery without naming the variant. Launched GJAW Nov 2025 at Rp525.5 jt (RWD) / Rp585.5 jt (iWD) (Chery, not stated OTR); Oct 2026 Moladin prices Rp580.5 / Rp645.5 jt. DC 30-80% in about 25 min. Moladin says AC 6 kW (9-10 h); a 7 kW wall charger is bundled. Chery's own pages also print J6-style 4,406 mm dimensions and 170 mm clearance in one table — 4,433 mm/225 mm used (Chery comparison page + Moladin). Lifetime battery/motor/controller warranty for the first 1,000 buyers only. Moladin also lists a J6T CSH, which is a PHEV and excluded.",
      "notes_id": "Tenaga gabungan 205 kW / 275 hp (94 hp depan + 181 hp belakang, Moladin; Chery 279 PS). 0-100 6,5 detik disebut Chery tanpa menyebut variannya. Diluncurkan di GJAW November 2025 seharga Rp525,5 jt (RWD) / Rp585,5 jt (iWD) (Chery, tidak disebutkan OTR); harga Moladin Oktober 2026 Rp580,5 / Rp645,5 jt. DC 30-80% sekitar 25 menit. Moladin menyebut AC 6 kW (9-10 jam); wall charger 7 kW disertakan. Halaman Chery sendiri juga mencantumkan dimensi 4.406 mm ala J6 dan ground clearance 170 mm di salah satu tabel — dipakai 4.433 mm/225 mm (halaman perbandingan Chery + Moladin). Garansi baterai/motor/controller seumur hidup hanya untuk 1.000 pembeli pertama. Moladin juga mencantumkan J6T CSH, yang merupakan PHEV sehingga tidak dimasukkan."
